---
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";
import Figure from "../components/Figure.astro";
---

<Page
	title="About us"
	kicker="Since 2012"
	description="Aequus Archers is a friendly, volunteer-run target archery club in Milford, Derbyshire, welcoming archers of every age and ability since 2012."
	intro="A friendly, volunteer-run target archery club in Milford, Derbyshire, welcoming archers of every age and ability since 2012."
>
	<section class="has-figure">
		<Figure
			src="community/our-story.jpg"
			alt="Aequus Archers members over the years"
			caption="Archers of every age and ability."
			align="right"
			accent="butter"
		/>
		<h2>Who we are</h2>
		<p>
			A group of coaches started Aequus Archers in 2012 to make archery a sport for everyone,
			whatever your age, gender, ethnicity, background or circumstance.
		</p>
		<p>
			<em>Aequus</em> is Latin for even, calm, equal, favourable, just and fair. That is the spirit
			we try to bring to every session.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>What we offer</h2>
		<p>Whether you want to try something new or take it further, there is a way in for you.</p>
		<div class="offers">
			<div class="offer">
				<h3>Taster sessions</h3>
				<p>A one-off 1.5-hour session to give archery a go. All equipment provided.</p>
				<a class="textlink" href="/sessions">See dates</a>
			</div>
			<div class="offer">
				<h3>Beginner’s courses</h3>
				<p>Four weekend sessions to learn the basics and earn your Archery GB certificate.</p>
				<a class="textlink" href="/sessions">See dates</a>
			</div>
			<div class="offer">
				<h3>Membership</h3>
				<p>Finished a course? Join us and shoot regularly through the season.</p>
				<a class="textlink" href="#membership">How to join</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="membership" class="membership">
		<h2>Becoming a member</h2>
		<p>
			To join an Archery GB–affiliated club like ours, you first need to complete a beginner’s
			course and receive your certificate. Then you are welcome to join Aequus Archers and shoot
			with us regularly through the season.
		</p>
		<p>
			Membership fees and how to pay are managed by the club. Get in touch and we will talk you
			through it.
		</p>
		<a class="btn" href="/contact">Ask about membership</a>
	</section>

	<section id="location" class="has-figure">
		<Figure
			src="community/the-field.jpg"
			alt="The Aequus Archers outdoor field at Milford, Derbyshire"
			caption="Our outdoor field at Milford."
			align="left"
			accent="sage"
		/>
		<h2>Where to find us</h2>
		<p>
			All sessions take place at our outdoor field in Milford, Derbyshire, during the summer
			season. Parking is free.
		</p>
		<p class="note">
			Directions, parking details and a map are coming soon. Until then, <a href="/contact"
				>contact us</a
			> if you need help finding us.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="outro">
		<h2>Come and have a go</h2>
		<p>Beginners are always welcome. Pick a taster or course date to get started.</p>
		<a class="btn" href="/sessions">See upcoming sessions</a>
	</section>

	<style>
		.offers {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
			gap: 20px;
			margin-top: 24px;
		}
		.offer {
			border-radius: var(--radius);
			padding: 24px;
			background: var(--pine-soft);
		}
		.offer:nth-child(2) {
			background: var(--butter-soft);
		}
		.offer:nth-child(3) {
			background: var(--coral-soft);
		}
		.offer p {
			font-size: 1rem;
		}
		.membership {
			background: var(--card);
			border-radius: var(--radius-l);
			padding: 36px;
		}
		@media (max-width: 640px) {
			.membership {
				padding: 26px 22px;
			}
		}
	</style>
</Page>
